{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">行政長官李家超率領司局長接種季節性流感疫苗。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李家超在社交平台發文，提醒接種疫苗可有效預防季節性流感、減低入院和死亡風險。政府推出優化措施，包括改進疫苗採購過程、增加醫生疫苗採購先導計劃、額度至30萬劑疫苗等，有助鼓勵和便利市民接種，合力築起社區免疫屏障。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CE-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026EzkZIDV94r1790137470.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CE-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T04:58:55.423738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}